<title>UK: ING sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond, 22 bp over.</title>
<headline>ING sets 1.0 billion mark 10-year bond, 22 bp over.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ING Barings.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTERNATIONALE NEDERLANDEN GROEP NV</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    04.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.915   PAY DATE    04.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	REOFFER    99.765    SPREAD	+22 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    FFT/AMS   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 5-50-1M   SALE LIMITS US/GB/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  NETHS     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.35	SELL CONC  2.15	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JULY 2007 DSL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
